ions with quantitative thresholds for large lepton asymmetry L~1e-2, secret interaction coupling G_X, or low reheating temperature T_RH and their independent BBN/CMB free-streaming constraints, and contrasting suppressed-thermalization emulator grid (illustrative Delta N_eff=0.2-0.3). Tool budget exhausted before read_arxiv_chunk and cite could run.
